# HStack Repo Conventions

This is a multi-platform agent plugin monorepo. Skills in `skills/` are shared across Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, and Cursor.

## Key Rules

- Every skill lives in `skills/<skill-name>/` with a `SKILL.md` entry point
- Skill `name` in frontmatter must match the directory name exactly
- SKILL.md frontmatter requires: `name`, `description`, `allowed-tools`
- Supporting files go in `references/`, scripts in `scripts/`
- Keep SKILL.md body under 500 lines — use references for overflow
- Cursor rules in `rules/` mirror skills with `.mdc` format
- Directories use `kebab-case`
- Do not put files other than `plugin.json` inside manifest directories (`.claude-plugin/`, `.codex-plugin/`, `.cursor-plugin/`)
- No secrets, API keys, or `.env` files
